  <item>
    <title>Vol.06 如果可以那就再宠爱自己一次吧</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66d5a8704a0f950f84f9ae69</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66d5a8704a0f950f84f9ae69</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 02 Sep 2024 11:58:40 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><strong><span>本期选题：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>把自己再养一次</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>本期主播：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>许念之、小舞、张喜强</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>本期话题：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="68">01:08</a> </span></strong><span>史记有言：“一家有罪而九家连举发，若不纠举，则十家连坐。”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="408">06:48</a> 一支笔的引发一场恶</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="902">15:02</a> 奇怪的饼干同桌</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="984">16:24</a> 会让孩子体验转学吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1244">20:44</a> 老师牌探照灯，只能照亮部分人</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1644">27:24</a> 孩子人生是旷野，大学不是人生的终点</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1824">30:24</a> 成绩不是唯一的目标，要寻找到属于自己的路</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2060">34:20</a> 不论什么工作只要完成自己的梦想就好啦</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2396">39:56</a> 人心冷暖，冷暖自知</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2962">49:22</a> 送礼乌龙事儿</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3120">52:00</a> 新欢与旧爱</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3600">60:00</a> 婚姻到底是什么呢？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3820">63:40</a> 如果重新抚养一次，自己一定会做什么？</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lpRpliN23g10pPFYTrhCncY85RQm.m4a" length="135316935" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:10:05</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fgmg4qrkaEq69jAN9BtAFXbQGkMo.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>Vol.05 颜控的天秤座，为何嫁给一个斑秃的老鼠脸丑男？</title>
