    <description><![CDATA[<p><strong><span>本期选题：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>朋友之间的分层</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>本期主播：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>张喜强、妩九、春丽、小舞</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>本期话题：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="68">00:01:08</a> 都有什么对朋友分层的习惯么？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="678">00:11:18</a> 朋友中，最有价值的是谁？价值是什么？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1419">00:23:39</a> 记得特别清楚的，体会到朋友分层的瞬间（老鼠脸丑男在这段）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2475">00:41:15</a> 分享下朋友交往中，会导致绝交的雷点</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3925">01:05:25</a> 朋友之间的分层，如何平衡</span></p>]]></description>
