  <item>
    <title>Vol.03 吃灰物品大盘点，这些东西你家里也有么？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66b9f82833591c27be86e478</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66b9f82833591c27be86e478</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 12 Aug 2024 11:55:20 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><strong><span>本期选题：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>吃灰物品大盘点</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>本期主播：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>张喜强、妩九、念之、小舞</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>本期话题：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="72">01:12</a> 最近的一个大家买完之后在家里面吃回的物品到底是啥？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="83">01:23</a> 这不是瘦脸面罩，这是刑具</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="249">04:09</a> 每个男孩子家里，都会有一套吃灰的哑铃</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="398">06:38</a> 我买的不是书，是City</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="586">09:46</a> 这不是象征着爱情的永生花，这是吃灰花</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="700">11:40</a> 痛失Switch一台</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="803">13:23</a> 衣柜里藏着的羞羞道具箱</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1077">17:57</a> 用不上的指甲油</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1163">19:23</a> 送礼，不送别人想要的，只送自己喜欢的</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1770">29:30</a> 送男生送什么礼物不会出错？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2211">36:51</a> 一开始觉得有用，但是最后去吃灰</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2917">48:37</a> 一直吃灰的东西，但是它在关键时刻却起到了奇效的东西</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3414">56:54</a> 虽然吃灰，但是丢了之后好后悔的东西</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lnLPz76bjgoXttC8Dm3cApZL4Ofv.m4a" length="99638009" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:08:41</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fgmg4qrkaEq69jAN9BtAFXbQGkMo.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
